[{"title":"春日田园杂兴","author":"了慧","text":"平畴水绕径微分，小圃云深景不繁。\n此处农桑虽是僻，多情莺燕不嫌村。\n倦眠芳草閒黄犊，静对幽花倒绿尊。\n见说弓旌方四出，欲更名姓掩衡门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32327,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"武陵胜集得园字","author":"有在","text":"骑马一身雪，来敲隐者门。\n林林忧桂玉，草草乐琴樽。\n勋业誇麟阁，文章鄙兔园。\n探题归去路，灯火已黄昏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32328,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"溥光","text":"卖与买人谁是主，一犁春雨鹁鸠啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32329,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天目山","author":"明本","text":"一山未尽一山登，百里全无一里平。\n疑是老僧遥指处，只堪图画不堪行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32330,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"净土诗二首 其一","author":"明本","text":"富贵之人宜念佛，黄金满库谷盈仓。\n世间受用无亏缺，只欠临终见愿王。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32331,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"净土诗二首 其二","author":"明本","text":"身膺宰辅与朝郎，盖世功名势莫量。\n自性弥陀如不念，未知何以敌无常。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32332,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"思母","author":"与恭","text":"霜陨芦花泪湿衣，白头无复倚柴扉。\n去年五月黄梅雨，曾典袈裟籴米归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32333,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冷泉亭","author":"与恭","text":"天竺雨花飞宝台，北山门对冷泉开。\n石擎老树无人识，时有黄猿抱子来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32334,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"回雁峰","author":"与恭","text":"官路迢迢野店稀，薄寒催客早添衣。\n南分五岭云天远，雁到衡阳亦倦飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32335,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"觉恩","text":"权拟三朝位三事，祗应知己是僧彬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32336,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题飞鸣宿食四雁图","author":"行端","text":"年去年来年复年，帛书曾达茂陵前。\n影连蓟北月横塞，声断江南霜满天。\n雨暗芦花愁夜渚，露香菰米下秋田。\n平生千里与万里，尘世网罗空自悬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32337,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠天纪","author":"一初","text":"翰苑虞夫子，名闻四海传。\n偶携天上月，来系寺前船。\n一见如曾识，三生定有缘。\n不嫌云卧冷，与我共留连。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32338,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寒食","author":"一初","text":"月暗花明掩竹房，轻寒脉脉透衣裳。\n清明院落无灯火，独向回廊礼夜香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32339,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晓过西湖","author":"一初","text":"水光山色四无人，清晓谁看第一春？\n红日渐高弦管动，半湖烟雾是游尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32340,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送人","author":"一初","text":"送子江头水亦悲，更能随我定何时？\n垂杨但为秋来瘦，不为秋来有别离。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32341,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"一初","text":"春路晴犹滑，山亭晚更深。\n竹枯湘泪尽，花发楚魂香。\n并坐夜深皆不语，一灯分映两閒身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32342,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠天纪","author":"圆至","text":"拈笔诗成首首新，兴来豪叫欲攀云。\n难医最是狂吟病，我恰才痊又到君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32343,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三高祠","author":"善住","text":"越国谋臣吴国雠，如何庙食此江头？\n扁舟载得蛾眉后，却作三江汗漫游。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32344,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江亭秋晚二首 其一","author":"本诚","text":"独倚清江秋思长，晚潮初上水亭凉。\n海门风起双峦暝，一抹银花涌夕阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32345,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江亭秋晚二首 其二","author":"本诚","text":"藤枯摧老树，石裂碍深溪。\n阴洞水声合，短垣松影齐。\n涧回知径远，山迥觉梅低。\n忽尔破孤寂，岭猿清昼啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32346,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"广漩","text":"寻光来佛后，窃食犯僧残。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32347,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其一 赤乌碑","author":"寿宁","text":"佛法阐兮重玄，国江东兮纪年。\n翠壁立兮高碣，瞰波涛兮硉矹。\n龟龙剥兮皇象书，千载一日兮传赤乌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32348,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其二 陈桧","author":"寿宁","text":"双桧兮苍苍，艺重玄兮祯明。\n蛟龙樛兮偃蹇，接叶蕤兮翔凤凰。\n皎琼树兮璧月夜流，望临春兮使我心忧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32349,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其三 虾子禅","author":"寿宁","text":"若有人兮慧如痴，啖生鲜兮俗见嗤。\n日而出兮暮而归，亡寒暑兮亡渴饥。\n虾既化兮虾活而飞，千秋万岁兮人是非。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32350,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其四 讲经台","author":"寿宁","text":"有美人兮沪之渚，徙神宫兮在芦野。\n筑高台兮垒土，天花缤兮如雨。\n倏奄没兮谷成陵，蹇予之仍兮绩乃成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32351,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其五 沪渎垒","author":"寿宁","text":"筑沪兮防海，芦之东兮沪之水。\n崧潭兮千秋，故垒岩岩兮枕江之流。\n风凄凄兮竹萧萧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32352,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其六 涌泉","author":"寿宁","text":"坤之机兮下旋，涌吾水兮泡漩。\n一气孔神兮无为自然，吁嗟泉兮何千万年！","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32353,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其七 芦子渡","author":"寿宁","text":"芦瑟瑟兮水溶溶，望美人兮袁之崧。\n雁呖呖兮心忡忡，眺东城兮江之中。\n吾将踏苇兮歌清风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32354,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏 其八 绿云洞","author":"寿宁","text":"万樾兮森森，云承宇兮阴阴。\n洞有屋兮云无心，我坐石兮鼓瑶琴。\n耶之溪兮华之嵓，云之逝兮吾将曷寻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32355,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赋盖","author":"祖柏","text":"百骨攒来一线收，葫芦金顶盖诸侯。\n一朝撑出马前去，真个有天无日头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32356,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"口占","author":"祖柏","text":"一封丹诏未为真，三杯淡酒便成亲。\n夜来明月楼头望，惟有嫦娥不嫁人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32357,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"祖柏","text":"谁呼蓬岛青头鸭，来杀松江赤縺蛇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32358,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"馆娃宫","author":"若舟","text":"白昼娃宫宴未旋，东风吹下越来船。\n捧心方妒三千女，尝胆谁知二十年。\n花暗屧廊蜂蝶困，草深香径鹿麋眠。\n凭栏一段伤心事，都在西山夕照边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32359,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词","author":"文信","text":"湖西日脚欲没山，湖东新月牙梳弯。\n南北两峰船里看，却比阿侬双髻鬟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32360,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"至刚","text":"菖蒲叶瘦黄花老，白虎黄猿自往来。\n砂锅常煮和根菜，不与人间气味同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32361,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游虎丘","author":"瞻","text":"城里看山看不足，花时雪后每来游。\n洗空尘土惟池水，磨尽英雄是石头。\n此日凭栏闻楚雁，何人掘冢得吴钩。\n东风又绿苍崖树，檀板娥笙醉未休。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32362,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题安分轩","author":"辨才","text":"知君近构竹间房，墙下新栽几树桑。\n采药不辞沾雨露，禦寒聊欲足衣裳。\n春深门外车无迹，秋晚篱边菊有香。\n我亦林泉安分者，向寻时过小池塘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32363,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"惟则","text":"开渠筑岸护低田，坐听邻翁说去年。\n卖却犁锄买渔网，儿童荡桨到床前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32364,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"普惠","text":"君王若问榆关郡，地瘦民贫山水多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32365,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"谒杨廉夫","author":"椿","text":"扬雄宅上好修竹，黄妃塔前多翠微。\n自爱高文每相见，莫怪短筇来叩扉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32366,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"良震","text":"六月七月生晚凉，大树小树临幽窗。\n枯槎行蚁过无数，晴空好鸟飞一双。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32367,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄杨廉夫","author":"照","text":"绝爱才多杨执戟，家住东吴锦绣场。\n姓氏已知传宇宙，玉堂新诵好文章。\n画船百丈牵春雨，铁笛一声鸣凤凰。\n海上相望千里隔，尺书无使为吾将。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32368,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"续兰亭会补任城吕系诗","author":"自悦","text":"崇阿抚神秘，微风扇和淳。\n灵雨既云沐，品汇区以陈。\n兰苕擢中沚，葩萼媚芳辰。\n散怀得真契，引觞答熙春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32369,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"续兰亭会补任城令吕本诗","author":"如阜","text":"禊饮秘图湖，天气淑且柔。\n传觞际曲渚，濯缨临芳洲。\n纤条乱风树，幽葩落晴沟。\n众宾亦以乐，正忘尘世忧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32370,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"续兰亭会补彭城曹諲诗","author":"福报","text":"柔条扇微风，轻波漾晴旭。\n群彦此委蛇，鸣条集中谷。\n列席依岩隈，飞觞随水曲。\n缅怀古先哲，庶以继遐躅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32371,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"福报","text":"东海人归双燕语，北窗病起百花飞。\n天台倒影三江北，太白垂芒九陇东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32372,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答邾仲谊","author":"宁","text":"公馀联骑入山城，老衲追陪得散行。\n短簿祠前看竹色，小吴轩上听松声。\n来游古苑春将暮，归去南楼月已明。\n题遍新诗佳胜处，定应商略过天平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32373,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹深处诗","author":"实","text":"修竹千竿一草堂，幽深偏爱水云乡。\n碧阴满地春帘湿，苍雪侵帏夏簟凉。\n诗刻粉筠初解箨，声传茶臼远飘香。\n宦游十载天南北，犹想园林思不忘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32374,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹深处诗","author":"回","text":"分得潇湘数亩阴，中藏茅屋往来深。\n半窗色净凉偏入，一榻声清暑不侵。\n雨长子孙金个个，风生头角玉森森。\n此君今向图中见，时报平安慰客心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32375,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"母生日","author":"明","text":"今朝是我娘生日，剔起佛前长命灯。\n白米自炊还自吃，与娘斋得一员僧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32376,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"广轮疆里图","author":"清浚","text":"万里山川咫尺中，江河迢递总朝东。\n当时汉帝曾披此，邓禹因之立大功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32377,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古","author":"越僧","text":"天定终南恃武功，不堪双泪湿东风。\n百年南渡斜阳外，十里西湖片雨中。\n燕子来时龙辇去，杨花飞彻凤楼空。\n倚筇曾向高峰望，山掩江城雾气笼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32378,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"禅僧","text":"一拳搥碎黄鹤楼，一脚踢翻鹦鹉洲。\n眼前有景道不得，崔颢题诗在上头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32379,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"游僧","text":"一拳搥碎黄鹤楼，一脚踢翻鹦鹉洲。\n有意气时消意气，不风流处也风流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32380,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵子昂书归去来辞","author":"无名僧","text":"典午河山半已墟，褰裳宵逝望归庐。\n翰林学士宋公子，好事多应醉里书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32381,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"戏笑隐","author":"无名僧","text":"欣哉笑隐住中峰，本是鸿儒学说空。\n罗刹江头潮未白，稽留峰下火先红。\n青霄有路干丞相，绀殿无颜见大雄。\n若使断江知此意，两人握手泣西风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32382,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠张伯雨","author":"无名僧","text":"久闻方外有神仙，只住华阳古洞天。\n花径不曾缘客扫，石床今许借僧眠。\n穿云去汲烧丹井，带雨来耕种玉田。\n一自茅君成道后，几人骑鹤下苍烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32383,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"无名僧","text":"百丈岩头挂草鞋，流行坎止任安排。\n老僧脚底从来阔，未必骷髅就此埋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32384,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"年节","author":"无名僧","text":"残年节礼送纷纷，尽是豪门与富门。\n惟有老僧阶下雪，始终不见草鞋痕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32385,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舞月歌","author":"骆妃","text":"五华兮如织，照临兮一色。\n丽正兮中域，同乐兮万国。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32386,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春夜吹笛词三首 其一","author":"程一宁","text":"兰径香销玉辇踪，梨花不忍负春风。\n绿窗深琐无人见，自碾朱砂养守宫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32387,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春夜吹笛词三首 其三","author":"程一宁","text":"淡月轻寒透碧纱，窗屏睡梦听啼鸦。\n春风不管愁深浅，日日开门扫落花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32388,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"惜春词","author":"程一宁","text":"春光欲去疾如梭，冷落长门苔藓多。\n懒上妆台脂盖蠹，承恩难比雪儿多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32389,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"弄月曲","author":"凝香儿","text":"蒙衫兮蕊裳，瑶环兮琼珰。\n泛予舟兮芳渚，击余楫兮徜徉。\n明皎皎兮水如镜，弄蟾光兮捉娥影。\n露团团兮气清，风飕飕兮力劲。\n月一轮兮高且圆，华綵发兮鲜复妍。\n愿万古兮每如此，予同乐兮终年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32390,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天香亭歌","author":"凝香儿","text":"天风吹兮桂子香，来阊阖兮下广寒。\n尘不扬兮玉宇净，万籁泯兮金阶凉。\n玄浆兮进酒，兔霜兮为侑。\n舞乱兮歌狂，君饮兮一斗。\n鸡鸣沈兮夜未央，乐有馀兮过霓裳。\n吾君吾王兮寿万岁，得与秋香月色兮酬酹乎樽觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32391,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"采菱曲","author":"凝香儿","text":"伽南楫兮文梓舟，泛波光兮远夷犹。\n波摇兮舟不定，扬余袂兮金风竞。\n棹歌起兮纤手挥，青角脱兮水潆洄。\n归去来兮乐更谁？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32392,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"凝香儿","text":"放渔舟兮湖之滨，剪荷柄兮折荷英。\n鸳鸯飞兮翡翠惊。\n张莲叶以为盖兮，缉藕丝以为衿。\n云光淡兮微烟生。\n对芳华兮乐难极，返予棹兮山月明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32393,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝笔诗","author":"顺帝宫人","text":"君王慧性被奸迷，妾曾三谏触闱墀。\n不能死守身先遁，致令钟移社稷墟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32394,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"耶律夫人","text":"挑灯教子哦新句，冷淡生涯乐有馀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32395,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"张阿庆","text":"洗砚黑云浮水面，折花红雨落墙头。\n满地梨花三月暮，隔墙杨柳两家春。\n秋水芙蓉妆镜晓，暖烟杨柳画屏春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32396,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题仲姬墨竹","author":"管道杲","text":"绿窗无长物，树蕙与滋兰。\n光风布淑气，扬扬畹亩间。\n窗外何所有，修竹万千竿。\n密叶敷午阴，劲节当岁寒。\n方欣同臭味，且以报平安。\n吾妹忽来顾，绿纱生薄寒。\n幔结贻佩纕，重重青琅玕。\n写真一挥洒，翰墨犹未乾。\n古意镇长在，高风渺难攀。\n况有斐比德，懿名垂不刊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32397,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"自题竹石","author":"管道升","text":"暮嶂远含青，春江带空碧。\n细看风前枝，抛书枕萝石。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32398,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父词四首 其一","author":"管道升","text":"遥想山堂数树梅，凌寒玉蕊发南枝。\n山月照，晓风吹，只为清香苦欲归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32399,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父词四首 其二","author":"管道升","text":"南望吴兴路四千，几时回去霅溪边。\n名与利，付之天，笑把渔竿上钓船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32400,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父词四首 其三","author":"管道升","text":"身在燕山近帝居，归心日夜忆东吴。\n斟美酒，鲙新鱼，除却清閒总不如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32401,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]